---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withSiteName } from '../../data/site';
const locale = 'en' as const;
const title = withSiteName(locale, 'Privacy Policy');
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description="Privacy policy and minimal-data explanation for the Lahore Fort travel guide." locale={locale} noindex={true}>
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="wrap legal-wrap">
      <h1>{title}</h1>
      <p>
        This privacy policy explains, in plain language, what little data this independent tourism guide
        collects, why, and the choices available to you. We are a non-profit information project and do not
        sell personal data.
      </p>

      <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
      <p>
        We do not require registration, do not run a comments system, and do not ask for your name, email
        address or payment details in order to read this guide.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics (only with your consent)</h2>
      <p>
        We use privacy-friendly analytics only after you grant consent through the cookie banner. Before
        consent, no analytics script is loaded. Aggregated, anonymous data may include the page viewed,
        approximate region and device type — never your identity.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Essential cookies keep the site working, such as remembering your cookie choice. Analytics and
        preference cookies are set only with your consent. You can change your choice at any time in
        Cookie Settings.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        This guide links to official and third-party sites (government bodies, maps, image sources). We are
        not responsible for their privacy practices; review their policies separately.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The guide is general-audience and informational. We do not knowingly collect data from children.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>If the policy changes, we will update the effective date shown below.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions, use the project's public repository or contact channel listed in the footer.
      </p>

      <p class="fine">Effective: 2026-09-17</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/">← Back to home</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
